# Cursor Rules for ShopKeeper
# Reference: See AGENTS.md for full instructions.

- Never use Double or Float for prices. Use Long minor units (cents).
- Never hardcode strings in Composables. Use res/values/strings.xml.
- Use "Buying Price" and "Selling Price" consistently.
- Single Source of Truth: UI observes Room database via StateFlow.
- Targeted test command: ./gradlew testProdDebugUnitTest
- Targeted lint command: ./gradlew lintProdDebug
